<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="dropzone" data-kv-variant="image" data-klic-component="dropzone" class="kn-dropzone"><header data-part="heading"><strong>커버 이미지</strong><p data-part="muted">권장 비율 16:9 · 로컬 파일 선택</p></header><label data-part="dropzone"><i data-part="icon" data-lucide="image" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>이미지 찾기</span><input type="file" accept="image/*" data-kv-files data-part="input"></label><ul data-kv-file-list aria-live="polite" data-part="list"><li>JPG, PNG, WebP 파일을 선택하세요.</li></ul></div>
